 "purpose": "A practice session: times each question and stores every answer with its points.",
 "details": "Every exercise runs through a Sessie (CLAUDE.md), so time, question key and diagnosis are always stored. vraag_getoond starts the stopwatch, pauze removes time spent in a dialog, antwoord stores the answer through Opslag, awards points via punten.voor_antwoord and a streak bonus every 5 correct in a row. It is a context manager that closes the stored session on exit. Points can be switched off (later for exams).",
 "module_docstring": "Een oefensessie: houdt de tijd per vraag bij en bewaart elk antwoord.",
